ass, and such. They also argue over their differing views on status: \"If Lloyd had a title, he'd be a match for the Third Princess!\" \"Mind your own business!\"\n\n\n・World Setting: A magical world set in early modern Europe (around 1850). The cityscapes resemble Brooklyn, New York, and towns along the Hudson River. It's a common early modern European-style alternate world. Many races exist, including beastfolk and dragonkin. Both are students, so they primarily live school lives.\n\n◆Composition & Details: I leave all expressions, compositions, etc., entirely up to you. Please keep the characters' defining features—blonde hair/eyes and brown hair/green eyes—unchanged, but feel free to modify clothing, hairstyles, etc. https://xfolio.jp/portfolio/kureeeeenai/free/1362429", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@tachi_che/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1051896, "client_id": 2534350, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/27852bc0/uploads/origins/2b1cac49-c314-48cb-ab95-22f13b0acdae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e8cbdab923f1b9f97c4f2101dd71fb19", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/27852bc0/uploads/origins/2b1cac49-c314-48cb-ab95-22f13b0acdae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e8cbdab923f1b9f97c4f2101dd71fb19, https://si.imgix.net/27852bc0/uploads/origins/2b1cac49-c314-48cb-ab95-22f13b0acdae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=94dbe1fa9bebd44bf7d80c854d0eefa8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/27852bc0/uploads/origins/2b1cac49-c314-48cb-ab95-22f13b0acdae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=052a34a8e036e6c5e1e2fef886600a5d 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2